<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Extended Analyses</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section reports additional results for experiments conducted in § <a href="#S4" title="4 Observable Structures Are Insufficient for Mechanistic Attribution ‣ Observable Patterns Are Not Explanations:A Causal-Geometric Analysis of Latent Reasoning Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, § <a href="#S5" title="5 When and How do LRMs use Latent Thoughts? ‣ Observable Patterns Are Not Explanations:A Causal-Geometric Analysis of Latent Reasoning Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and § <a href="#S6" title="6 The Dynamics and Geometry of Latent Thoughts ‣ Observable Patterns Are Not Explanations:A Causal-Geometric Analysis of Latent Reasoning Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
