<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Epiphenomenal Patterns in LRM Interpretability (§ ). ‣ Appendix B Statistical Evaluation ‣ Observable Patterns Are Not Explanations:A Causal-Geometric Analysis of Latent Reasoning Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> reports the results for case study 1 (superposition and BFS-like search on graph-hopping); Table <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Epiphenomenal Patterns in LRM Interpretability (§ ). ‣ Appendix B Statistical Evaluation ‣ Observable Patterns Are Not Explanations:A Causal-Geometric Analysis of Latent Reasoning Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> reports results for case study 2 (scratchpad reasoning on arithmetic-reasoning via logit-lens).</p>
</div>
</section>
