<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 14: </span>Hyperparameters used to train the GPT-2 CoT, PaT, Coconut, and
Coconut<sub id="A3.T14.5" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A3.T14.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">u</span></sub> models. Coconut rows report both the standard setting
(<math id="A3.T14.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u=0.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u=0.0</annotation></semantics></math>) and the stage-mixed Coconut<sub id="A3.T14.6" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A3.T14.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">u</span></sub> setting (<math id="A3.T14.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u=0.3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u=0.3</annotation></semantics></math>).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.T15" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A3.T15.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A3.T15.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A3.T15.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter</span></td>
<td id="A3.T15.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A3.T15.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GSM8K-Aug</span></td>
<td id="A3.T15.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A3.T15.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ProsQA</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T15.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
